--- a/docs/wmenu.1.scd	2026-09-16 21:12:54.637185907 +0100
+++ b/docs/wmenu.1.scd	2026-09-16 21:15:50.162199725 +0100
@@ -33,6 +33,10 @@
 *-b*
 	wmenu appears at the bottom of the screen.
 
+*-c*
+	wmenu appears as a box centered on the screen, sized to its widest item
+	rather than spanning the full width. Overrides *-b*.
+
 *-i*
 	wmenu matches menu items case insensitively.
 
@@ -53,7 +57,8 @@
 	https://docs.gtk.org/Pango/type_func.FontDescription.from_string.html
 
 *-l* _lines_
-	wmenu lists items vertically, with the given number of lines.
+	wmenu lists items vertically, with at most the given number of lines.
+	A shorter list shrinks the menu to fit rather than padding it out.
 
 *-o* _output_
 	wmenu is displayed on the output with the given name.
